      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s only okay to `throws Exception` for testing method (the method annotated with `@Test`, or @Before or @After). For any other methods, please throws specific checked exceptions, no matter how long the list can be. See go/java-practices/exceptions#documentation",
